  "description": "This package provides token usage tracking, cost estimation, and pricing analytics for Azure OpenAI services. It enables developers to monitor and optimize token consumption across different AI models, calculate usage costs, and implement budget controls for AI operations. Supporting multiple .NET frameworks (.NET Standard 2.0, .NET 8, and .NET 9), it offers a comprehensive solution for organizations seeking to manage and forecast expenses related to large language model implementations.",
